{"id": "ret-101", "category": "returns", "query": "can i send back a lamp i bought 3 weeks ago if i just dont like it", "reference": "Yes. Home decor can be returned within 30 days of delivery if it is unused and in its original packaging. Because it is a change-of-mind return, a ₹79 reverse-pickup fee is deducted from the refund unless you are a ShopNest Plus member.", "needs_context": true, "type": "answerable", "pair_id": null, "should_cache_hit": null, "author": "yourname"}
{"id": "pay-101", "category": "payment", "query": "I want to pay ₹8,000 with EMI on my credit card for 3 months. Is that allowed and what does it cost?", "reference": "Yes. Standard card EMI is available on orders of ₹3,000 and above, with 3-month tenure available. Interest is charged by your bank, typically 13–16% a year. No-cost EMI needs an order of ₹10,000 or more, so it does not apply to ₹8,000.", "needs_context": true, "type": "hard", "pair_id": null, "should_cache_hit": null, "author": "yourname"}
